OL,5,G0215 Below Deck Mediterranean
OL,6,     FThere's nothing like the
OL,7,     Ftranquillity of being out at sea.
OL,8,     FBut the calm is shattered when a
OL,9,     Fgroup of loud, brash New Yorkers
OL,10,     Fboard the boat.
OL,11,G0300 Below Deck Mediterranean
OL,12,     FThe charter season draws to a
OL,13,     Fclose, but not before two
OL,14,     Fcrewmembers double down on a
OL,15,     Fterrible decision...
OL,16,G0345 Brooklyn Nine-Nine
OL,17,     FDebbie: When cocaine and weapons
OL,18,     Fare stolen from the evidence
OL,19,     Flock-up, the squad must
OL,20,     Finvestigate the Nine-Nine itself.
